viewer markdown tabs freeze on inline-code lines | 2026-07-16-viewer-markdown-infinite-loop.html | code-bug 012-spec-viewer viewer markdown | markdownToHtml paragraph guard excluded lines starting with an inline backtick that no block branch consumed — line index never advanced, infinite loop froze the tab. isBlockStart() now mirrors dispatch; progress guaranteed.
